        "height": 300,
        "content": "ThreatLens SOC Agent\n\nSchedule -> Config -> Create session -> Load demo logs -> POST /api/ingest -> Wait/Poll /api/jobs -> GET /api/threats -> AI Agent with tools -> IF risk >= 80 -> Slack/email payload/dismiss.\n\nThis version avoids HTTP calls from Code nodes, matching n8n Code node restrictions. Use dedicated HTTP Request nodes/tools for network calls."
      }
